We won't be caught.

299
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,440
What are you waiting for?

300
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,240
Hurry up!

301
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:15,959
Any slower

302
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,519
and the guards are on us.

303
00:15:18,159 --> 00:15:19,240
Here, hold this for me.

304
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:19,960
Okay.

305
00:15:29,159 --> 00:15:29,519
Let's go.

306
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,279
Go.

307
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:35,000
How's that?

308
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,279
Never thought

309
00:15:37,519 --> 00:15:38,559
the first day would be

310
00:15:38,879 --> 00:15:39,639
so exciting.

311
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,200
Stick with me,

312
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,639
and more excitement to come.

313
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:45,480
Who's there?

314
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,120
"Submarine"!

315
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:46,639
Which class are you two in?

316
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:46,879
What "Submarine"?

317
00:15:46,879 --> 00:15:47,840
Let's bolt!

318
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:48,759
Don't you run!

319
00:15:48,759 --> 00:15:49,559
Stop right there!

320
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:04,320
[Hello?]

321
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:06,279
[Alright.]

322
00:16:06,279 --> 00:16:07,360
[I'm on my way.]

323
00:16:07,759 --> 00:16:08,600
[Okay.]

324
00:16:09,039 --> 00:16:09,960
That was quick.

325
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:17,759
He's gone.

326
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,159
He scared me!

327
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:24,320
Take a seat.

328
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:25,000
Relax.

329
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:28,320
Here, some water.

330
00:16:28,799 --> 00:16:29,159
Thanks.

331
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,519
Why do you

332
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,120
call the dean "Submarine"?

333
00:16:33,279 --> 00:16:34,279
His surname is Qian.

334
00:16:34,799 --> 00:16:35,360
Plus he's always

335
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,399
popping out of nowhere.

336
00:16:36,639 --> 00:16:37,080
You never know

337
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:37,879
where he'll emerge.

338
00:16:38,279 --> 00:16:39,240
If he's not like a "submarine",

339
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:39,919
then what is he like?

340
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:41,279
Fair point.

341
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,320
Stick with me,

342
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:44,480
and you'll be fine.

343
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,200
After the ceremony,

344
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,440
I'll sneak you back to class.

345
00:16:47,679 --> 00:16:48,879
No one will find out.

346
00:16:49,159 --> 00:16:49,600
Okay.

347
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,039
Li Haoyu?

348
00:16:55,799 --> 00:16:56,480
Milk Tea Senior.

349
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:58,879
No milk tea today?

350
00:16:59,519 --> 00:17:00,759
Don't mention it.

351
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,120
I just had some milk tea from last night.

352
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,599
which nearly killed me.

353
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,359
Again.

354
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,559
Keep watch for me.

355
00:17:10,559 --> 00:17:11,720
Don't touch anything.

356
00:17:11,839 --> 00:17:12,960
Got it.

357
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,039
Mr. Connections.

358
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:18,000
Just the usual.

359
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:19,000
You and I have been through

360
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,319
a crisis together today.

361
00:17:20,319 --> 00:17:22,480
I've got your back around school from now on.

362
00:17:22,799 --> 00:17:23,480
Okay.

363
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,359
I'm Li Haoyu,

364
00:17:24,559 --> 00:17:25,200
lead drummer and captain

365
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,240
of Pulsar Band.

366
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:27,160
That's awesome.

367
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,119
What's your name?

368
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:30,519
I'm...

369
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,599
You're also called Gu Chenyang?

370
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,079
No,

371
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:36,319
this name badge is...

372
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,640
What do you mean by "also"?

373
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:39,920
Because I know another guy

374
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:40,720
called Gu Chenyang.

375
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,440
Really?

376
00:17:41,450 --> 00:17:42,440
Sure.

377
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,599
Is it him?

378
00:17:48,519 --> 00:17:50,240
That's him, Gu Chenyang.

379
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:52,119
[This cold fish.]

380
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:54,240
[This morning I tried to do the right thing,]

381
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:56,240
yet he snapped at me instead of the bad guy.

382
00:17:56,559 --> 00:17:57,720
[I'm about to be late]

383
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:58,680
[but he doesn't lift a finger.]

384
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,680
[Cold, heartless,]

385
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,839
[and untrustworthy.]

386
00:18:01,839 --> 00:18:03,240
[Plus he always looks so grumpy.]

387
00:18:08,759 --> 00:18:09,599
Today, you two

388
00:18:09,599 --> 00:18:10,880
have made yourselves famous.

389
00:18:12,319 --> 00:18:13,480
Give me my things back.

390
00:18:16,799 --> 00:18:18,400
What on earth are you doing?

391
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:22,240
I knew you were in on it

392
00:18:23,119 --> 00:18:24,680
Li Haoyu.

393
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,599
You are really something.

394
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:27,799
Unbelievable.

395
00:18:30,359 --> 00:18:31,480
Three years in junior high,

396
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,359
you were known as

397
00:18:32,359 --> 00:18:33,319
the troublemaker.

398
00:18:33,599 --> 00:18:35,240
On the first day of senior high,

399
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:36,640
you've found your

400
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:38,160
dynamic duo.

401
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,839
Respect teachers, be friendly to classmates,

402
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:41,279
and abide by school regulations,

403
00:18:41,279 --> 00:18:43,400
all of which are ignored by you.

404
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:45,599
Tardiness, climbing over walls, and disrupting order.

405
00:18:45,599 --> 00:18:47,279
You've done it all.

406
00:18:47,279 --> 00:18:47,960
Do you still

407
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,079
respect the school rules?

408
00:18:50,799 --> 00:18:52,359
Dean, we're sorry.

409
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:54,279
We truly didn't mean it.

410
00:18:54,319 --> 00:18:56,440
We just don't know the equipment.

411
00:18:56,759 --> 00:18:57,400
Next time...

412
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,759
Next time?

413
00:19:00,759 --> 00:19:02,000
Do you realize

414
00:19:02,279 --> 00:19:03,319
how much damage

415
00:19:03,319 --> 00:19:05,039
you've caused to the school?

416
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:06,960
Dean,

417
00:19:07,279 --> 00:19:09,160
we added a delay to the livestream.

418
00:19:09,359 --> 00:19:10,160
Once the incident happened,

419
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,240
the signal was cut immediately.

420
00:19:11,559 --> 00:19:12,920
The actual impact is limited.

421
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:14,079
Please don't worry too much.

422
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,160
But the harm done to Gu Chenyang

423
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,519
is undeniable, isn't it?

424
00:19:19,519 --> 00:19:20,200
You two

425
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:21,960
apologize to him.

426
00:19:22,799 --> 00:19:24,599
We're really sorry, Gu.

427
00:19:24,599 --> 00:19:25,839
Sorry for the trouble.

428
00:19:25,839 --> 00:19:26,599
It's my fault.

429
00:19:26,599 --> 00:19:28,880
Li Haoyu? Li Haoyu!

430
00:19:29,119 --> 00:19:30,559
You got a problem with that?

431
00:19:38,119 --> 00:19:40,039
An apology shows proper attitude,

432
00:19:40,359 --> 00:19:41,880
but punishment still stands.

433
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,640
You two will receive a minor demerit.

434
00:19:44,119 --> 00:19:45,559
Dean, is that really necessary?

435
00:19:45,559 --> 00:19:46,000
Dean,

436
00:19:46,519 --> 00:19:47,039
could you give them

437
00:19:47,039 --> 00:19:48,039
another chance?

438
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:51,000
Maybe write self-criticisms

439
00:19:51,519 --> 00:19:53,160
and complete campus service

440
00:19:53,519 --> 00:19:54,759
to make amends.

441
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,079
They're freshmen after all.

442
00:19:56,599 --> 00:19:57,799
We could show some leniency.

443
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:58,920
Zhou Yang,

444
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:01,119
as the Student Council President,

445
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:02,720
you shouldn’t always try to be everyone's friend.

446
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,640
Rewards and penalties must be fair.

447
00:20:05,799 --> 00:20:06,480
Besides,

448
00:20:07,119 --> 00:20:08,480
the one in charge of the control room

449
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,400
is from the Arts and Sports Department

450
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:10,480
of the Student Council, isn't it?

451
00:20:10,559 --> 00:20:11,319
So the Student Council

452
00:20:11,319 --> 00:20:12,720
needs to demonstrate accountability.

453
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,400
Come in.

454
00:20:18,519 --> 00:20:19,160
Dean,

455
00:20:19,759 --> 00:20:21,119
the school nurse said the Arts and Sports Minister

456
00:20:21,119 --> 00:20:22,720
has acute gastroenteritis.

457
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,079
He's already been taken to hospital.

458
00:20:24,759 --> 00:20:25,640
As you see,

459
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:27,480
there are mitigating circumstances.

460
00:20:28,079 --> 00:20:29,440
As for these two,

461
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,839
they did disrupt

462
00:20:30,839 --> 00:20:31,799
Gu's speech.

463
00:20:32,359 --> 00:20:33,079
How about

464
00:20:33,319 --> 00:20:34,920
making them copy the speech

465
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,839
five times?

466
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,319
Fu Binyan,

467
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,359
you're the Vice President.

468
00:20:40,359 --> 00:20:41,279
What's your opinion?

469
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:42,519
It doesn't matter.

470
00:20:43,319 --> 00:20:45,319
They didn't interfere with my violin playing anyway.

471
00:20:51,079 --> 00:20:52,359
Maybe we should

472
00:20:52,559 --> 00:20:53,519
follow the President's advice.

473
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:55,000
Dean,

474
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:56,640
Jiang Yi isn't here,

475
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,200
but out of the three presidential votes,

476
00:20:58,480 --> 00:20:59,880
we already have two in favour.

477
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:00,519
In your opinion...

478
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,400
Alright.

479
00:21:06,279 --> 00:21:07,799
Just follow Zhou Yang's advice.

480
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,119
Thank you, Sir.

481
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:10,000
Make it ten copies

482
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,279
and give it to me tomorrow.

483
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,000
Not enough?

484
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,960
N-no, not at all.

485
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,240
Fu Binyan.

486
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:20,599
Thanks

487
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,039
for earlier.

488
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,799
I was helping the Arts and Sports Department,

489
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:25,599
not you.

490
00:21:27,759 --> 00:21:28,960
You still blame me?

491
00:21:29,319 --> 00:21:30,799
Because of the game last semester?

492
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,119
You're overthinking it.

493
00:21:34,319 --> 00:21:36,119
Then why did you stop playing basketball?

494
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,319
Zhou Yang,

495
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,920
since when have you become so talkative?

496
00:21:41,599 --> 00:21:42,200
Let's go.

497
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,839
The Student Council still has work to do.

498
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,519
About what just happened,

499
00:22:00,119 --> 00:22:00,799
I'm sorry.

500
00:22:11,039 --> 00:22:11,680
You freak

501
00:22:12,319 --> 00:22:13,279
look so grumpy.

502
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:14,799
That's just how he is.

503
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:18,240
I've been meaning to ask you.

504
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,079
Are you two close?

505
00:22:21,359 --> 00:22:21,839
Not really.

506
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,000
There's no way I'd be close

507
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,400
to someone with such a permanent scowl.

508
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,000
But back there you two…

509
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:26,839
Alright, alright.

510
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:27,720
Drop it.

511
00:22:27,839 --> 00:22:28,440
We just met.

512
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,039
Let's add WeChat.

513
00:22:29,039 --> 00:22:29,960
Yeah, good idea.

514
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,720
Come on.

515
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,039
It's okay.

516
00:22:33,039 --> 00:22:33,720
Got it.

517
00:22:34,759 --> 00:22:37,000
Li Haoyu.

518
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:38,880
Call me Bro Yu.

519
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:39,640
Okay.

520
00:22:39,759 --> 00:22:40,240
Bro Yu.

521
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:43,480
See, request sent.

522
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,400
Yep.

523
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:46,079
I'm Lin Qingyuan.

524
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:46,880
It's me.

525
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,759
Hey, bro, is this yours?

526
00:23:27,759 --> 00:23:28,440
Yes.

527
00:23:28,559 --> 00:23:29,400
Thank you.

528
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,480
I'm Xu Anbo.

529
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,279
Lin Qingyuan.

530
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:33,079
I know who you are.

531
00:23:33,079 --> 00:23:35,079
The opening ceremony guy.

532
00:23:35,559 --> 00:23:36,359
That's right.

533
00:23:36,839 --> 00:23:37,759
And Li Haoyu.

534
00:23:37,759 --> 00:23:38,400
Mm-hmm.

535
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,160
Who's talking about me?

536
00:23:52,759 --> 00:23:53,480
Help pass these out.

537
00:23:53,559 --> 00:23:54,880
Here, Zhou Yang, hand them around.

538
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,920
Most of you attended Yibei Junior High,

539
00:24:01,599 --> 00:24:03,079
so you should be familiar with the school.

540
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:05,759
Our school values solid academic foundations,

541
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:09,079
as well as character and all-round development.

542
00:24:09,279 --> 00:24:10,160
I hope that

543
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:11,759
while focusing on your studies,

544
00:24:12,039 --> 00:24:12,960
you will also actively develop

545
00:24:12,960 --> 00:24:14,240
your hobbies and interests.

546
00:24:20,279 --> 00:24:22,079
Club Recruitment Day will be this Saturday.

547
00:24:22,319 --> 00:24:23,720
This semester,

548
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,440
the school encourages everyone to join clubs.

549
00:24:25,839 --> 00:24:26,720
Participation in club activities

550
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:28,680
will count towards your club evaluation scores.

551
00:24:29,319 --> 00:24:31,160
Please choose carefully.

552
00:24:31,759 --> 00:24:32,839
If possible,

553
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:35,160
I hope you can lead by example

554
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,640
and help the new members

555
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,160
settle into the clubs quickly.

556
00:24:39,319 --> 00:24:40,200
Well done.

557
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:54,799
[Club activities...]

558
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:30,880
[We grow in different surroundings]

559
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:35,920
[and weather different storms.]

560
00:25:37,559 --> 00:25:41,440
[But as long as we chase]

561
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,599
[the bright side,]

562
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:48,119
[we will all grow into]

563
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:51,960
[who we want to be.]

564
00:25:53,599 --> 00:25:54,839
This cold fish.

565
00:25:55,599 --> 00:25:56,920
His writing is pretty good.

566
00:26:07,079 --> 00:26:08,680
Finally finished copying.

567
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:51,440
Grow into who we want to be.

568
00:27:04,519 --> 00:27:05,119
Hey,

569
00:27:05,119 --> 00:27:06,160
toss the ball over here.

570
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:07,000
Over here!

571
00:27:18,039 --> 00:27:19,279
Perfect shot, bro.
